      "expected": "The specification describes a single ATtiny-driven fan controller, and the ISP wiring matches ATtiny13 SPI pins (PB0/PB1/PB2). If an ATtiny45 were intended, its ISP MISO/SCK pins are PB3/PB4, not PB1/PB2; otherwise only one MCU footprint should be connected and populated.",
